</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1144820/extras/4d1d19be1364a683d019a0b7fb97a620.avif?t=1569309728\" width=596 height=364 /></span><br>Buy a variety of food or equipment items and equip them to one of four slots.  Some items heal you instantly while others can restore your super meter.  Equipment effects can vary from boosting your damage output.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skill shop</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1144820/extras/ca52acf0b43b8438c8d7a7d754665f75.avif?t=1569309728\" width=596 height=364 /></span><br>Have you met Harry?  He can teach you how to play AND he can teach you new skills.  Swap out any technique for any other within the same category to customize whatever character you choose to match your own play style.","developers":["Chicken Picnic"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1144820/header.jpg?t=1569309728","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1144820/238667/5b3b83d86617ad41ef4f66fb870178d09afd2dc8/1751194893/dash_av1.mpd?t=1566665531","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1144820/238667/5b3b83d86617ad41ef4f66fb870178d09afd2dc8/1751194893/dash_h264.mpd?t=1566665531","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1144820/238667/5b3b83d86617ad41ef4f66fb870178d09afd2dc8/1751194893/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1566665531","id":256759298,"name":"Alpha Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256759298/movie.293x165.jpg?t=15